<title>RUSSIA: Yeltsin signs Svyazinvest, Rostelekom decree.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin signs Svyazinvest, Rostelekom decree.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian President Boris Yeltsin has signed a decree on growth of the telecom industry and the future of Svyazinvest holding company and Rostelekom long distance carrier, a presidential spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>The presidential press service unable to give details of the decree. </p>
<p>Nail Izmailov, chief executive of AO Svyazinvest said last week Yeltsin soon would authorise the sale of 49 percent of Svyazinvest and the transfer of 38 percent of Rostelekom, including 51 percent of voting shares, to Svyazinvest.</p>
<p>--Peter Henderson, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
